        "created_at": "2013-04-07T15:44:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, if it comes up, the Talisman counts as a villain <em>character</em> card, not just a villain card, because it flips and doesn't have a regular deck back like normal villain cards. &nbsp;There are some things you can't do to character cards, so it could come up in a game for you.</p>",
